msgid "# Hy4-Flash(Experimental)"
msgstr "# Hy4-Flash（实验性）"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 简介"

msgid ""
"The \"PD Separation Deployment\" mentioned in this document is provided only"
" as an example/reference design to demonstrate the basic process of "
"deploying Prefill and Decode in separated mode. It is not recommended for "
"use in the production environment."
msgstr ""
"本文档中提到的“PD 分离部署”仅作为示例/参考设计提供，用于演示以分离模式部署 Prefill 与 Decode 的基本流程，不建议在生产环境中使用。"

msgid ""
"**For the production environment on the customer side, [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend is recommended.**"
msgstr ""
"**客户侧生产环境建议使用 [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend。**"

msgid ""
"This release has been validated only on 950DT products. A2 and A3 have not "
"yet been validated; support is planned for future releases."
msgstr "本版本仅在 Ascend 950DT系列产品 上完成验证。A2 与 A3 尚未验证，计划在后续版本中支持。"

msgid ""
"Hy4-Flash is a Mixture-of-Experts model with sliding-window attention, "
"IndexPool sparse attention, iHC, and Engram conditional memory. The "
"checkpoint has 42 language-model layers and an embedded five-layer DFly "
"draft for speculative decoding."
msgstr ""
"Hy4-Flash 是一个混合专家（MoE）模型，采用滑动窗口注意力、IndexPool 稀疏注意力、iHC 以及 Engram 条件记忆。该权重包含 "
"42 层语言模型层，并内嵌了一个用于投机解码的五层 DFly draft。"

msgid ""
"This document covers environment and model preparation, single-node "
"deployment, PD disaggregation, functional verification, accuracy and "
"performance evaluation, and performance tuning on 950DT products."
msgstr "本文档涵盖 Ascend 950DT系列产品 上的环境与模型准备、单节点部署、PD 分离、功能验证、精度与性能评测以及性能调优。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features"
msgstr "## 2 支持的特性"

msgid ""
"Refer to the [Supported "
"Models](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) page for the "
"support matrix and the [Feature "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) for feature configuration."
msgstr ""
"支持矩阵请参阅[支持的模型](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)页面，特性配置请参阅[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)。"

msgid ""
"The deployment scripts use native FP8 weights, BF16 computation, FP8 KV "
"cache, expert parallelism, and Model Runner V2. The Decode service enables "
"five-token DFly speculative decoding. All serving examples enable "
"asynchronous scheduling. The single-node and Prefill examples enable prefix "
"caching; PD Decode disables it."
msgstr ""
"部署脚本使用原生 FP8 权重、BF16 计算、FP8 KV cache、专家并行以及 Model Runner V2。Decode 服务启用五 "
"token 的 DFly 投机解码。所有服务示例均启用异步调度。单节点与 Prefill 示例启用前缀缓存；PD Decode 则禁用前缀缓存。"

msgid "## 3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "## 3 前提条件"

msgid "### 3.1 Model Weight"
msgstr "### 3.1 模型权重"

msgid ""
"Prepare the Hy4-Flash FP8 checkpoint, including its tokenizer, model "
"configuration, Engram tables, and embedded DFly weights."
msgstr "准备 Hy4-Flash FP8 权重，包括其 tokenizer、模型配置、Engram 表以及内嵌的 DFly 权重。"

msgid "| Weight Version | Deployment | Download Links |"
msgstr "| 权重版本 | 部署机型 | 下载链接 |"

msgid ""
"| Hy4-Flash FP8 | 950DT products | "
"[ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/models/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-flash-FP8) |"
msgstr ""
"| Hy4-Flash FP8 | Ascend 950DT系列产品 | "
"[ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/models/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-flash-FP8) |"

msgid ""
"Download the complete checkpoint to a local directory on each deployment "
"host. In Section 4.1, replace `<HY4_FLASH_FP8_PATH>` with that host "
"directory. The container mounts it at `/models/Hy4-Flash-FP8`, which is the "
"model path used by the serving and benchmark commands below."
msgstr ""
"将完整权重下载到每台部署主机的本地目录。在第 4.1 节中，将该主机目录替换 `<HY4_FLASH_FP8_PATH>`。容器会将其挂载到 "
"`/models/Hy4-Flash-FP8`，即下方服务与基准测试命令所使用的模型路径。"

msgid "### 3.2 Verify Multi-node Communication"
msgstr "### 3.2 验证多节点通信"

msgid ""
"Prepare the NPU interconnect by following [Verify inter-node "
"connectivity](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#verify-"
"multi-node-communication-environment)."
msgstr ""
"请按照[验证节点间连通性](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#verify-"
"multi-node-communication-environment)中的说明准备 NPU 互联。"

msgid ""
"Prepare the UB endpoint configuration directory used by "
"`ascend_local_comm_res_path`. Set `UB_ENDPOINTS_PATH` to that directory in "
"both role scripts."
msgstr ""
"准备 `ascend_local_comm_res_path` 所使用的 UB endpoint 配置目录。在两个角色的脚本中，将 "
"`UB_ENDPOINTS_PATH` 设置为该目录。"

